eptance Rate:**\nThe acceptance rate for the oral track was 6.6%. While the search results mention this oral acceptance rate specifically, they don't provide the overall conference acceptance rate (which would include both oral and poster presentations).\n\nThe search results indicate that detailed statistics are available on platforms like Paper Copilot, though the specific overall acceptance numbers weren't fully captured in these particular results. For the most comprehensive acceptance rate data including total accepted papers, you may want to check the official Paper Copilot CoRL 2024 statistics page directly or the OpenReview submissions system.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3c89458-961d-4d5e-a388-373831b4983c","uuid":"5dffd33c-3e3d-4022-9e89-7cc42251f1f7","timestamp":"2026-05-15T16:37:09.192Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2024 acceptance rate statistics submissions accepted","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01KZk1hc7jJPhDSbXfA6bAeB","content":[{"title":"CoRL Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/"},{"title":"CORL 2024 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2024-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2024-paper-list/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024","url":"https://2024.corl.org/"},{"title":"GitHub - Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate: Statistics of acceptance rate for the main robotics conference · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/Po-Jen/Robotics-Conference-Acceptance-Rate"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 Conference Submissions | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/submissions?venue=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2024/Conference"},{"title":"USC at the Conference of Robot Learning (CoRL) 2024 - USC Viterbi | School of Engineering","url":"https://viterbis