{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YCzuSJpiVGsCRFAGgM5kgC","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"site:2024.corl.org instruction for reviews rating scale\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Papers XX\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/papers-xx\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Call for Workshops\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/call-for-workshops\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Awards\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/awards\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instructions for Presentations\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instructions-for-presentations\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Workshops\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/workshops\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Speakers\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/speakers\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Demos\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/program/demos\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found the CoRL 2024 \"Instruction for Reviews\" page. However, the search results show general information about the review process and criteria but do not contain specific details about a rating scale for reviews.\n\nThe page discusses how submissions will be evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, and results will be judged on the degree to which they have been objectively established and their potential for scientific and technological impact, as well as their relevance to robotic learning. It also outlines that ACs will identify desk rejection candidates and the PC will examine the candidates and make the final decision.\n\nHowever, the specific rating scale instructions are not included in the search results returned. To find the detailed rating scale used for CoRL 2024 reviews, you may need to visit the full page directly at https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews or check the OpenReview submission platform where the detailed review forms would be available.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f3c89458-961d-4d5e-a388-373831b4983c","uuid":"bb0a4c4f-9a99-4454-9582-e34903599c91","timestamp":"2026-05-15T16:37:26.340Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"site:2024.corl.org instruction for reviews rating scale","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Ubt9VT6S41grJETb9KvGAf","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Papers XX","url":"https://2024.corl.org/program/papers-xx"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Call for Workshops","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/call-for-workshops"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Awards","url":"https://2024.corl.org/program/awards"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instructions for Presentations","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instructions-for-presentations"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Call for Papers","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Workshops","url":"https://2024.corl.org/program/workshops"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Speakers","url":"https://2024.corl.org/program/speakers"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Demos","url":"https://2024.corl.org/program/demos"}]},"Based on the search results, I found the CoRL 2024 \"Instruction for Reviews\" page. However, the search results show general information about the review process and criteria but do not contain specific details about a rating scale for reviews.\n\nThe page discusses how submissions will be evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, and results will be judged on the degree to which they have been objectively established and their potential for scientific and technological impact, as well as their relevance to robotic learning. It also outlines that ACs will identify desk rejection candidates and the PC will examine the candidates and make the final decision.\n\nHowever, the specific rating scale instructions are not included in the search results returned. To find the detailed rating scale used for CoRL 2024 reviews, you may need to visit the full page directly at https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews or check the OpenReview submission platform where the detailed review forms would be available."],"durationSeconds":4.977075744999994}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GqeQKPSyxgic5upE7bEKa8","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines rating scale \"overall score\" \"1\" \"10\" site:corl2023.org\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2023 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2023/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2025-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2023%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"url\":\"https://corl2022.org/frequently-asked-questions/\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Reviewer Guidelines\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewerguidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"Review Form\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform\"}]\n\nI found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page, but the search results don't show the specific rating scale details for the \"overall score\" on a 1-10 scale. The first search result shows general guidance about reviewing practices but doesn't include the rating scale specifics. Let me search more specifically for the rating scale information.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilo