{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014dsS75aTkYYuo99cpZnTax","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/meta_brain_lora_routing/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# meta_brain_lora_routing — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 15:47 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP kickoff: 引用 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml, Dream 已启动\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nPerturbation-Adaptive LoRA Routing：从冻结 π₀ 内部激活诊断扰动类型，路由到专用 LoRA expert 做针对性修正。详见 `paper_framing.md`。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\nCoRL 2026 — Abstract DDL: 2026-05-26 (11天)，Paper DDL: 2026-05-29 (14天)\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (from paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. **Perturbation Diagnosability** — 单层单步即可完美分类扰动类型 (Phase 0 验证通过)\\\\n2. **Targeted > Uniform Correction** — 扰动专用 LoRA > 通用 LoRA (Phase 1 待验证)\\\\n3. **Parameter-Efficient Robustness** — 6M params vs VLA-GSE 114M (Phase 1+2 待验证)\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- 阶段：**Research** (MVP 通过 2026-05-15)\\\\n- Phase 0 ✅ GO: 3-class F1=0.993, K=1 F1=0.898, layer6 K=1=1.0\\\\n- Phase 1: 准备中 — 等待 Dream 模拟回调 (`dream_20260515T154653`) 后批准 P0 实验\\\\n- 实验计划: 12 个实验 (P0: 5, P1: 3, P2: 4)，详见 `experiment_plan.yaml`\\\\n- 覆盖率: 用 `compute_coverage_matrix()` 派生，不手画\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] Phase 0 GO 判定 (D004)\\\\n- [x] complete_mvp() 进入 research 阶段\\\\n- [x] 写 paper_framing.md\\\\n- [x] 写 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n- [x] 启动 dream_simulate(review_mode=\\\\\\\"full\\\\\\\")\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 回调 → 审视 framing/plan 是否需要调整\\\\n- [ ] 批准 P0 实验 (plan_002: LoRA training, plan_003: assembly)\\\\n- [ ] Phase 1 LoRA training 代码准备 + 数据准备\\\\n- [ ] Phase 1 训练启动（4 GPU 并行: LoRA-V/S/P + Universal）\\\\n\\\\n## Phase 0 残留项（并行补完，不阻塞 Phase 1）\\\\n- [ ] objects_layout + robot_initial_states per_step 数据重收集 + 完整 3-class few-shot\\\\n- [ ] sensor_noise 重收集（等 LIBERO-Plus assets 下载）\\\\n- [ ] eval_classifier.py 修正（只报告 CV 数字）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 当前分配：4× RTX PRO 6000 96GB @ westd-34142\\\\n- 已用：~25 GPU-hrs（Phase 0）\\\\n- 计划：P0=95h, P1=25h, P2=65h，总计 185h（190h 预算内）\\\\n\\\\n## 架构决策 (from Phase 0)\\\\n- Router: PaliGemma layer 6 单层, mean pooling, 2-layer MLP\\\\n- LoRA: 作用于 PaliGemma 层（Expert 不编码扰动差异）\\\\n- 路由延迟: 单次前向传播即可决策\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-15 | PAR Router 改用 first-token pooling（F1 1.000 vs mean | phase0_activation_collection |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-15 | 进入 Research 阶段 — 完成 paper_framing.md + experiment_ | phase0_activation_collection |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-15 | Phase 0 GO — 核心假设验证通过，进入 Phase 1 LoRA expert 训练 | phase0_activation_collection |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-15 | Phase 0 架构修正：层索引改为 Gemma 2B 的 18 层范围 + 排除 Language | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-15 | 采纳 Reviewer 4 条建议增强 Phase 0：+binary sanity check,  | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-15 | MVP 定义为 Phase 0 early-kill gate：验证 π₀ 内部激活能否分类 3 类 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2348, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SCpZUDUWJBkc4eqtEYBXAg","session_id":"f3c89458-961d-4d5e-a388-373831b4983c","uuid":"93c9e974-3b17-40de-888d-a2b1ee831e15","timestamp":"2026-05-15T16:39:14.717Z"}
