{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RD1a56z7Tum9cSv6M2vHBf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tdreams:\n2\t  dream_20260515T154653:\n3\t    dream_id: dream_20260515T154653\n4\t    project: meta_brain_lora_routing\n5\t    status: reviewing\n6\t    review_mode: full\n7\t    review_visible: true\n8\t    writing_visible: true\n9\t    venue: CoRL 2026\n10\t    focus: 'Key risks: (1) Phase 0 classification too easy — does routing actually\n11\t      help downstream? (2) Single backbone pi0 generalizability. (3) Absolute performance\n12\t      vs SRPO/VLA-GSE SOTA. (4) 3-class taxonomy coarseness. Strongest evidence: Phase\n13\t      0 K=1 layer6 F1=1.0 proves zero-overhead routing. Core question for Claim 2:\n14\t      does specialized LoRA outperform universal LoRA?'\n15\t    what_if: []\n16\t    pid: 55748\n17\t    chat_id: oc_c6486cbe84daf76dab4c6af0c685f2ea\n18\t    card_message_id: om_x100b6f47b012c0a4c3674a8c7736fa2\n19\t    started_at: '2026-05-15T15:46:53+00:00'\n20\t    updated_at: '2026-05-15T16:26:27+00:00'\n21\t    stages_completed:\n22\t    - imagine\n23\t    - write\n24\t    error: null\n25\t    context_hash: 81ab94c0974bccda9ec328f91356f88107e61570628ed916bcd8f79e1d3a3640\n26\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LQ4Te7gZVbHZuRYt6tuXWZ","session_id":"f3c89458-961d-4d5e-a388-373831b4983c","uuid":"49494cad-09fd-4d77-9bdf-9673c5afe7da","timestamp":"2026-05-15T16:39:16.779Z"}
